    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scintillŭla</span></b> , ae, f.
		dim.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				little spark</i>, <i>sparklet</i> (rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eas in pueris virtutum quasi scintillulas
					videmus, e quibus accendi philosophi ratio debet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 5, 15, 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Anim. 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 2, 4, 91</span></i>
			 Fleck.</div>
